:name: SAMD21 GRBL smoke
:description: Boots the GRBL SAMD21 port and exposes SERCOM3 UART on a TCP socket terminal.

# Variables (override before including this script):
#   $elf       - ELF to load  (default: build/grbl_samd21_dbg.elf)
#   $uart_port - TCP port for the SERCOM3 UART socket terminal (default: 3456)

using sysbus

$elf?=@build/grbl_samd21_dbg.elf
$uart_port?=3456

mach create "grbl-samd21"
# Compile the 16-bit TC access shim (see its header comment) before the
# platform description references Timers.SAMD21_Timer16.
include @ci/renode/SAMD21_Timer16.cs
# Compile the TCC0 (spindle PWM) register-observability shim (see its
# header comment) before the platform description references
# Timers.SAMD21_TCC.
include @ci/renode/SAMD21_TCC.cs
machine LoadPlatformDescription @ci/renode/samd21_grbl.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
    # No VectorTableOffset override needed:
    #  - reset entry (initial SP/PC): Renode guesses the vector base 0x200
    #    from the ELF ("Guessing VectorTableOffset value to be 0x200") - the
    #    emulation analogue of the rSamba bootloader handing off to the app;
    #  - interrupt dispatch: startup.c programs SCB->VTOR = vector_table
    #    itself. Renode models the 0xE000ED08 write; verified by booting with
    #    VectorTableOffset forced to 0x0 plus only a stub SP/PC pair at 0x0 -
    #    banner and "$$" still worked and VecBase read back 0x200.
"""
runMacro $reset

emulation CreateServerSocketTerminal $uart_port "uartsrv" false
connector Connect sysbus.sercom3 uartsrv

# Log every PORT OUT write that drives the X STEP pin (megarm: PA25) high.
# MPos alone cannot prove step output: sys_position increments in the
# Bresenham branch even when the step-bit OR truncates (BUG #17 phantom
# motion), so the motion smoke additionally requires XSTEP_HIGH lines in the
# Renode log (asserted by smoke.sh --motion). ~10 us pulses are far below
# monitor sampling resolution; a write hook catches every single one.
sysbus SetHookBeforePeripheralWrite portA "if offset == 0x10 and (value & (1 << 25)) != 0: self.InfoLog('XSTEP_HIGH')"

echo "SAMD21 GRBL smoke machine ready; UART on socket port:"
echo $uart_port
